<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Komag cut. [CORRECTED 18:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Komag cut. [CORRECTED 18:40 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said its U.S. priority list committee downgraded Komag Inc to the recommended list from the priority list. (Goldman corrects to show that U.S. priority list committee made downgrade, not analyst Richard Schutte.)</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-9/16 to 27-5/16.</p>
</text>
